# Security and secrets

- Never create, request, display, store, or commit secrets or `.env` values.
- Never touch seed phrases, private keys, wallet recovery data, or signers.
- Network access is off by default.
- No provider/API/RPC, push, PR, account creation, or package adoption without an explicit GPT-control-plane-approved atom.
- No absolute machine paths, usernames, or account emails in tracked artifacts.
- `.env.example` remains placeholder-only.
- See `AGENTS.md` sections `NO_SECRETS`, `EXTERNAL_ACTIONS`, and `WORKSPACE_ONLY`.
